<title>UK: Kredietbank sets 250 mln guilder perpetual bond.</title>
<headline>Kredietbank sets 250 mln guilder perpetual bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KREDIETBANK INTERNATIONAL FINANCE NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  KREDIETBANK NV</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DFL   COUPON   * 6.75	MATURITY  * PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.75</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.50</p>
<p> NOTES    * CALL AT PAR AFTER 10 YEARS, WHEN COUPON STEPS UP TO</p>
<p>		2.5 PCT ABOVE THE THEN 10-YEAR DSL</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) **	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   DOMESTIC</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	**CF FORM 5-100-1M, K-FORM 5-50</p>
<p> NOTES    PAY DATE 30.OCT.96</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
